    "description": "Barling Make International Grenadier\nBent Briar Tobacco Pipe, Shape 913\nMade in Denmark\nBarling Make International estate pipe crafted in Denmark during the 1970s. Featuring a deeply rusticated finish with rich burgundy undertones, this bent shape 913 pipe exemplifies fine Danish briar carving produced under the historic Barling marque. It comes complete with its original Barling presentation box and cloth sleeve.\nRusticated briar bowl and shank with rich reddish-brown finish\nBlack bent stem featuring the Barling cross logo and white accent ring\nStamped \"Barling MAKE INTERNATIONAL\", \"MADE IN DENMARK\", and \"913\"\nIncludes original Barling 1812 box and branded drawstring pouch\nCondition:\nPipe is in excellent pre-owned condition. Briar displays intact rustication with no cracks or burn marks. Bowl chamber and rim are clean with no charring. Stem fits snugly with a glossy black finish and no tooth chatter or oxidation. Original box and pouch show light storage wear.",
